    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootimals - Collect. Hatch. Complete. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Lootimals \u2014 the ultimate idle pet collection game where every 30 minutes could bring you your next favorite critter! Whether you're grinding for that legendary Cuburtle or just trying to finish your Moolox set, there's always something worth hatching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drops Every 30 Minutes \u2013 watch the loot roll in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch Unique Creatures \u2013 Each drop is a surprise egg containing a randomly rolled Lootimal with its own name, style, and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch eggs for new egg skins, click away to unlock new ingame backgrounds, all while collecting new pets for your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity Tiers \u2013 From adorable commons to legendary beasts, the thrill of the chase is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements Galore \u2013 Completionists rejoice we've got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No battles. No pay-to-win. Just you, your Lootimals, and the slow grind of fate. Lootimals is the chill companion you didn\u2019t know you needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-minute drop cycles (even while minimized!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently 5 different Lootimals with 6 rarity tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time rarity-based hatching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full collection tracker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Lootimals - Convert Into Tickets - Use Tickets On Missing Lootimals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love idle games, collectibles, and the satisfaction of seeing your pet library fill out, Lootimals is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop Rates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 95.53% 1 in About 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon 3.43% 1 in 29</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare 0.82% 1 in 121</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very Rare 0.14% 1 in 740</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic 0.07% 1 in 1375</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary 0.010% 1 in 9630</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootimals - Collect. Hatch. Complete. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Lootimals \u2014 the ultimate idle pet collection game where every 30 minutes could bring you your next favorite critter! Whether you're grinding for that legendary Cuburtle or just trying to finish your Moolox set, there's always something worth hatching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How it Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drops Every 30 Minutes \u2013 watch the loot roll in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch Unique Creatures \u2013 Each drop is a surprise egg containing a randomly rolled Lootimal with its own name, style, and rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch eggs for new egg skins, click away to unlock new ingame backgrounds, all while collecting new pets for your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity Tiers \u2013 From adorable commons to legendary beasts, the thrill of the chase is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements Galore \u2013 Completionists rejoice we've got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No battles. No pay-to-win. Just you, your Lootimals, and the slow grind of fate. Lootimals is the chill companion you didn\u2019t know you needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-minute drop cycles (even while minimized!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently 5 different Lootimals with 6 rarity tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time rarity-based hatching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full collection tracker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Lootimals - Convert Into Tickets - Use Tickets On Missing Lootimals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love idle games, collectibles, and the satisfaction of seeing your pet library fill out, Lootimals is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop Rates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 95.53% 1 in About 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon 3.43% 1 in 29</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare 0.82% 1 in 121</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very Rare 0.14% 1 in 740</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic 0.07% 1 in 1375</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary 0.010% 1 in 9630</p>",
